{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">名古屋亞運壁球混雙，港隊兩隊包辦決賽席位，歷史性包攬金、銀牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄧銘漮及李嘉兒，四強以局數2-1擊敗印度組合，黎卓楠與謝依霖就直落兩局淘汰馬來西亞對手，肯定為港隊取得一金一銀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳善鈺在女單四強，以局數0-2不敵馬來西亞的施華辛嘉莉，仍取得銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劍擊方面，港隊女子花劍及男子佩劍隊，都在團體賽四強落敗，獲得銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.WRAP-2100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026g7QLo1A9zX1790442646.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.WRAP-2100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T17:38:16.792613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}